          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be sites.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a functor.\nAssume that\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0004> is cocontinuous,\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> <MATH_0005> is continuous, and\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003> fibre products and equalizers exist in <MATH_0006> and\n<MATH_0007> commutes with them.\n<STRUCT_0003>\nIn this case the functor <MATH_0008> above commutes with fibre products and\nequalizers (and more generally with finite connected limits).\n<STRUCT_0004>",
