          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a morphism of\n<MATH_0003>. The inclusion functor\n<MATH_0004>\nis cocontinuous and induces a morphism of topoi\n<MATH_0005>\nFor a sheaf <MATH_0006> on <MATH_0007>\nwe have the formula <MATH_0008>.\nThe functor <MATH_0009> also has a left adjoint <MATH_0010> which commutes\nwith fibre products and equalizers.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
